<Layout title="Privacy"><div class="wrap narrow"><PageHeader title="A little less to worry about." kicker="PRIVACY" back="/privacy/" backLabel="Privacy"/><article class="content-panel prose"><p>D.El.Ed Buddy does not require an account. This version has no advertising, analytics or student accounts.</p><h2>What stays on your device</h2><p>Saved resources, unit progress, checklist ticks and your colour preference are stored in this browser’s local storage. They are not synchronized across devices. Clearing browser data removes them.</p><p>Search runs in your browser. Queries stay in this browser. Your search appears in the page URL, so a link you share may include it.</p><h2 id="submissions">Contributions and issue reports</h2><p>When you submit a contribution or issue report, the form fields are sent to Formspree for processing and delivery to Sayeem Sadik. This may include your name, email, material link, report details and page information. Formspree may also process technical data for spam prevention. This website does not save form drafts in browser storage.</p><p>Contact details are used to review submissions and follow up, and won’t be published. Contributions will be reviewed before publication, with name credit only when requested.</p><p>See <a href="https://formspree.io/legal/privacy-policy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Formspree’s privacy policy</a>. For questions about your submission or to request deletion of copies held by the project, email <a href="mailto:leoaristocratjr@gmail.com">leoaristocratjr@gmail.com</a>.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>Fonts are requested from Google Fonts. The supplied HTML study notes also load Tailwind CSS and KaTeX from their original public CDNs for styling and mathematical notation. Hosting providers may process ordinary technical request data. A private hosted preview may require the host’s sign-in; D.El.Ed Buddy itself does not create student accounts. External websites and PDF viewers have their own privacy practices.</p><button class="button secondary" id="clear-data">Clear my saved study data</button><p id="clear-status" role="status" class="small spaced"></p><p class="small muted">Updated 26 September 2026.</p></article></div></Layout>
